    "scenes": [
      {
        "id": "scene-01-01",
        "order": 1,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-company",
        "characterPosition": "center",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "今天是我入职的第一天。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-01-02",
        "order": 2,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-company",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "经历了千辛万苦，我终于来到了这家一直想加入的公司。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-02-01",
        "order": 3,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-lobby",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-character-hr",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "嗨，你就是今天入职的 Jenny 吧？"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-02-02",
        "order": 4,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-lobby",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "我是好公司的 HR。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-02-03",
        "order": 5,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-lobby",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-encourage",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "今天就由我来带你完成入职准备啦。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-02-04",
        "order": 6,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-lobby",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "（不愧是好公司……）"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-02-05",
        "order": 7,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-lobby",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "（HR 都这么亲切。）"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-01",
        "order": 8,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "center",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "这就是你之后使用的电脑。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-02",
        "order": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "不过准确地说，这是你的前辈留下来的电脑。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-03",
        "order": 10,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "前辈？"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-04",
        "order": 11,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-happy",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "他以前可是我们这里非常厉害的人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-05",
        "order": 12,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-encourage",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "不过现在已经财富自由啦。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-06",
        "order": 13,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-happy",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "最近正在欧洲到处旅行。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-07",
        "order": 14,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-happy",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "今天可能在法国，过几天可能就去西班牙了。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-08",
        "order": 15,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "（财富自由……）"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-09",
        "order": 16,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "（到处旅行……）"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-03-10",
        "order": 17,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "好羡慕。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-04-01",
        "order": 18,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "因为前辈现在没有办法亲自回来带新人，所以把以前的项目和工作资料都留在了电脑里面。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-04-02",
        "order": 19,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "他还在电脑里设置了一套特别的新人学习系统。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-04-03",
        "order": 20,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-happy",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "据他说，不管以后谁来接手，都可以慢慢从里面学会他的工作方式。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-04-04",
        "order": 21,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "哇……"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-04-05",
        "order": 22,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "好厉害的前辈。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-04-06",
        "order": 23,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "（如果我把这些全部学会，我以后也能变成这样吗？）"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-05-01",
        "order": 24,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "今天你就先熟悉一下这台电脑吧。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-05-02",
        "order": 25,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-introduce",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "一会儿我会把员工手册和后面的入职安排发给你。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-05-03",
        "order": 26,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-happy",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "等你学习完，我们再继续之后的培训。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-05-04",
        "order": 27,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-office",
        "characterAssetId": "asset-hr-encourage",
        "characterPosition": "right",
        "speaker": "HR",
        "text": "加油，新人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-05-05",
        "order": 28,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-desk",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "那就……"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-05-06",
        "order": 29,
        "enabled": true,
        "backgroundAssetId": "asset-bg-desk",
        "speaker": "Jenny",
        "text": "看看这位传说中的前辈到底留下了什么吧。"
      }
    ]
  },
